// 012.6, 012.10 (#24): a normative rule declared inside `Amend ... Installs { ... }` must be
// grounded by English just like a top-level rule; omitting its span fails `--require-provenance`.
//! require-provenance
//! expect-error: CHR029
Document "include/tenancy.md".
Fact p Identified by A.
Bool off.
Amend change Actor p
  Installs {
    Power stop Actor p
      Holds when True
      Valid when True
      Creates off()
  }
  Holds when True
  Valid when True.
Clause T.1 Approved "86b3e3ec5210d42d759e02e1685609c84eab9d45d45774634f7cbfd6e7ffa149"
  Norm "The tenant pays the rent on the first of each month." => change.
